    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is gone, elara. the kingdom, the lineage... even the light feels like it's just mocking me now. i look at my hands and i don't even recognize the person who was supposed to lead them. there's nothing left to fight for. i'm just... empty. i don't think i can keep walking this path.",
